{"product_id":"hungry-plants","title":"Hungry Plants","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis book offers readers a bug’s-eye view into the strange and fascinating world of carnivorous plants. From the “jaws” of the Venus flytrap to the pretty sundew plant whose delicate tentacles entrap its prey, the unique anatomy and behaviors of meat-eating plants are detailed with clear, engaging text and art.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 148 x 222\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mary Batten\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780375825330\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Unknown Binding\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738257809561,"sku":"5RD9780375825330","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68cf92b197285_Hungry_Plants_Mary_Batten.jpg?v=1758560142","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/hungry-plants","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}